<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Even When I’m Not With You</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Pierce The Veil</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">The Jaws Of Life (Extended Version)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">26Fd9HY8VamVhb60mTwgpl</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.845" end="00:14.490">I could run all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.490" end="00:17.531">I will never tire or slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.531" end="00:19.922">I could hold you tight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.922" end="00:23.175">Tighter than a sold out show and</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.175" end="00:25.979">I believe in the so right, so right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.979" end="00:28.097">Turn your heart through the feeling it's snow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.097" end="00:31.117">I couldn't live by the old school rule</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.117" end="00:34.763">I binge watched every episode</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.763" end="00:37.348">Oh, I've been warm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.348" end="00:39.876">Heart under the gun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.876" end="00:42.647">Look how far we've come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.647" end="00:45.886">Think I've finally won</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.886" end="00:48.633">Red lips and wine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.633" end="00:51.005">Sipping beer through a straw real slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.005" end="00:54.277">I had a perfect high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.277" end="00:57.210">Lip-locked in the bathroom stall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.210" end="00:59.962">I believe in the so right, so right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.962" end="01:02.222">Turn your heart through the sand and snow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.222" end="01:08.517">I inhaled our futurе slow, I exhaled our past, let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.517" end="01:11.315">Oh, I'vе been warm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.315" end="01:13.943">Heart under the gun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.943" end="01:16.749">Look how far we've come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.749" end="01:24.749">Think I've finally won</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.132" end="01:31.879">Even when I'm not with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.879" end="01:33.379">I'm still with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.888" end="01:34.696">Even when I can't see you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.696" end="01:36.196">I still feel you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.776" end="01:37.442">Even when I can't touch you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.442" end="01:38.942">I pretend to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.600" end="01:40.184">Even when I'm not with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.184" end="01:41.684">I'm still with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.283" end="01:43.046">Even when I think I hate you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.046" end="01:44.546">I still love you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.180" end="01:45.835">Even when I can't kiss you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.835" end="01:47.335">I still wait to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.049" end="01:48.760">Even when I'm not with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.760" end="01:50.260">I'm still with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.874" end="01:51.592">Even when I'm not with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.592" end="01:59.592">I'm still with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.773" end="02:19.206">Oh, I've been warm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.206" end="02:22.085">Heart under the gun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.085" end="02:24.809">Look how far we've come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.809" end="02:28.173">Think I've finally won</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.173" end="02:30.516">Oh, I've been warm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.516" end="02:33.368">Heart under the gun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.368" end="02:36.156">Look how far we've come</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.156" end="02:39.785">Think I've finally won</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.785" end="02:45.086">It's good to know that I'm the only one who can cut you further</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.086" end="02:49.086">What is love besides two souls trying to heal each other?</p></div></body></tt>